  "contentHtml": "<p>줄넘기 탐구활동을&#160;</p><p>모둠별로 주제를 정하고, 탐구계획을 세우라고 하면&#160;</p><p>어려워 하는 학생들이 많습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/0V5VhODjm2A?si=JzUDqhfFj2ACAPYb\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/0V5VhODjm2A?si=JzUDqhfFj2ACAPYb</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0V5VhODjm2A\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"868\" data-video-height=\"488\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/b3aSQy/hyWrKlzBlE/LPR6PRhtwyszPk7ItHwEJ0/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"868\" data-video-origin-height=\"488\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/0V5VhODjm2A\" width=\"868\" height=\"488\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p>그래서</p><p>챗 GPT에게 아래와 같이 프롬프트를 넣었습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/53208e93e23931df17bcd6c0ddb038228930145c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/53208e93e23931df17bcd6c0ddb038228930145c\" data-origin-width=\"558\" data-origin-height=\"91\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4399b49ab870d0448a73ee71246db09a40be0e6c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4399b49ab870d0448a73ee71246db09a40be0e6c\" data-origin-width=\"706\" data-origin-height=\"724\"></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8